window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>When FBI Agent Hannah Mercy transfers back home to Lincoln, Nebraska to care for her ailing father, she expects a quiet life—but finds herself embroiled in solving mysteries from the past, and hunting down diabolical killers....</b><br> <br> Forgotten tragedies resurface as Hannah Mercy links a macabre string of murders to the dark days of the 1980s farm crisis. With victims displayed among haunting relics, Hannah must dig through history's wreckage to prevent another name from being added to this killer’s morbid museum.<br> <br> Come Home is book two in a new series by bestselling and critically acclaimed mystery and suspense author Rylie Dark, whose books have received over 2,000 five-star reviews and ratings. The series begins with <i>Come Close.</i><br> <br> The Hannah Mercy series offers a captivating take on the mystery genre, filled with unexpected twists and intense suspense. Its cleverly-crafted lead character, a brilliant but flawed heroine, will win your affection and keep you listening long into the night. Fans of Robert Dugoni, Melinda Leigh, Lisa Gardner, and Teresa Driscoll are sure to fall in love.<br> <br> Future books in the series are also available!</p>"; 
